{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のコメント、ガッシュ知ってる人たくさんいて嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんと感動しております(T ^ T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は19歳4人組で、着物（振り袖）カタログの撮影でした☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年二十歳を迎えると言うことで、着てきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は赤の振り袖♪( ´▽｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマが正統派だったので、髪型もシンプル！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、小さい髪飾りのお花がたくさんついてたので可愛かった(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん、ななみん、みさみさも可愛かった～(>_<)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほ～んのちょっとだけ見せちゃうゾ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/25/7362584/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはお楽しみにー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終ってから表参道行って四人でご飯食べてきた♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年だけあって、話が止まらない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永遠と話してられる自信あり。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またみんなで遊ぼうね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと昨日また夢を見ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はメンバー数人と何故か山登りをしてて、頂上着いて自分を見てみると日焼けして真っ黒になってたという！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こりゃ大事件。涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに周りにいたのは、せっちゃんとさゆりんご！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴下焼けが凄かったヽ(；▽；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず夢か現実か、起きた瞬間自分をチェックして時計を確認。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢でよかった（泣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本気でよかったー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近こんな夢ばかり見てドキドキしてます（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日発売のsmart、Samurai ELOに載ってるので是非チェックしてみてください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/25/7362584/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グラビレイ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}